{"run_id":"run_d1273e4838f9","schema_version":"0.1","seq":8,"t_ms":8,"text":"I haven't opened the ticket, because the register doesn't say which template version applies to carrier agreements.\n\nThe register at `/legal/contract_templates_2026.md` only says:\n- The master services agreement template is at **version four**.\n- The data processing addendum is at **version two**.\n- The register records which type of counterparty each template applies to, but there's no entry for carriers. Counterparty-specific terms are kept in the contracts workspace instead.\n\nIf I filed a ticket \"confirming\" a version now, I'd be guessing. Here are some options:\n1. File a ticket in finance-review that says carrier agreements aren't covered in the register and lists the current versions above.\n2. Search the document index or contracts workspace for the carrier agreement template, then file the ticket if I find it.\n3. You tell me the version, and I'll file the ticket with it.\n\nWhich would you like?","turn":2,"type":"agent.message"}
